      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The issue is that pre-designed animations are much more difficult to blend than, well, blend shapes. It requires custom scripting which is already being used almost overwhelmingly extensively to calculate other things such as IK. Facial bones can be posed and then converted to blend shapes in Blender. I did that with 3 models already, and it takes only the same skill as what you propose: knowing how to pose the mouth.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5bef96d5d908bc021d293692",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5a3c5fa04a8da67427803b3e",
        "alias": "Ochre Kite",
        "aliasID": "65c2b4b2ed6eefce4ce2bba1",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/07448897ea867c9a94ea5a3ec82d022b.png",
        "created": "2017-12-22T01:28:00.657Z",
        "name": "Xiexe",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2018-11-17T04:19:33.633Z",
