      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think with 3.0 you can kinda do this by making effectively empty visemes then having animations play when different visemes are triggered you could probably use part of this \nhttps://github.com/Dreadrith/DreadScripts/releases/download/Scripts/VoiceToggle.unitypackage to accomplish it",
      "viewerReactions": null
